hustler-mindset/
├── index.html                 (Registration — Phase 1)
├── login.html                 (Login — Phase 2)
├── hustlermindset.html        (Bidder Platform — Phase 3)
│     ├── Overview tab
│     ├── Job Board tab (filters, apply redirect, pagination)
│     ├── My Profiles tab (assigned profiles, resume download)
│     ├── Vortex AI tab (autopilot chat)
│     ├── My Applications tab (tracking)
│     ├── Daily Reports tab
│     ├── Earnings & Wallet tab (USD + NGN)
│     ├── Weekly Reports tab
│     └── Profile Settings tab
├── admin.html                 (Super Admin + Admin Dashboard — Phase 4)
│     ├── Overview (stats, revenue, profit)
│     ├── Pending Approvals
│     ├── All Users (bidders + admins)
│     ├── Profile Assignment (modal per bidder)
│     ├── Financials (revenue/profit by week)
│     ├── Applications Monitor
│     ├── Daily Reports Review
│     └── System Settings (job sources toggle, rate display)
├── api/
│   └── index.js               (Backend — Phase 5)
│         ├── POST /api/auth/check           (verify token, return role/status)
│         ├── POST /api/admin/approve        (owner only)
│         ├── POST /api/admin/ban            (owner only)
│         ├── POST /api/profiles/assign      (admin/owner)
│         ├── POST /api/profiles/list        (bidder: own profiles; admin: assigned by them)
│         ├── POST /api/jobs/refresh         (cron or manual trigger)
│         ├── GET  /api/jobs/list            (cached job feed)
│         ├── POST /api/jobs/export          (xlsx generation)
│         ├── POST /api/ai/autopilot         (OpenRouter proxy, profile-scoped)
│         ├── POST /api/applications/record  (bidder records application)
│         ├── GET  /api/finance/rates         (USD/NGN)
│         └── POST /api/reports/daily        (submit daily report)
├── vercel.json                (Cron config for job refresh)
├── firebase-rules.json        (Security rules — provided with Phase 5)
└── package.json               (firebase, xlsx, node-fetch, etc.)
